WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.701
Coordinator (Australian female): Good afternoon, Riverside Arts Centre.

00:00:03.161 --> 00:00:05.863
Caller (British male): Hello. I'd like to book an evening course.

00:00:06.343 --> 00:00:08.707
Coordinator (Australian female): Of course. Can I take your surname?

00:00:09.047 --> 00:00:12.548
Caller (British male): Patel. P, A, T, E, L.

00:00:12.968 --> 00:00:14.529
Coordinator (Australian female): Which course interests you?

00:00:14.869 --> 00:00:18.403
Caller (British male): I first considered photography, but I'd prefer pottery.

00:00:18.883 --> 00:00:24.387
Coordinator (Australian female): The pottery course starts on the sixth of November, not the fourth as shown in the old leaflet.

00:00:24.867 --> 00:00:25.714
Caller (British male): That's fine.

00:00:26.134 --> 00:00:32.648
Coordinator (Australian female): The full fee is eighty-five pounds. The ninety-five-pound figure includes an optional exhibition ticket.

00:00:33.128 --> 00:00:34.117
Caller (British male): What is included?

00:00:34.457 --> 00:00:46.741
Coordinator (Australian female): All basic materials are included, and students may use the evening studio without extra charge. Tools can be hired, refreshments are sold downstairs, and parking costs four pounds.

00:00:47.321 --> 00:00:49.114
Caller (British male): How will I receive the timetable?

00:00:49.454 --> 00:00:54.532
Coordinator (Australian female): We'll email it this afternoon. Your membership card must be collected at reception.

00:00:55.012 --> 00:00:56.837
Caller (British male): What time does the class begin?

00:00:57.177 --> 00:01:02.108
Coordinator (Australian female): At six thirty. The building opens at six and the tutor arrives at six fifteen.

00:01:02.588 --> 00:01:08.306
Caller (British male): Perfect. I chose this centre because the classes are small, so I should receive more feedback.

00:01:08.786 --> 00:01:10.406
Coordinator (Australian female): I'll reserve your place now.
